flowchart LR
    USER[用户 / 浏览器] --> UI[Vue 3 前端]
    UI -->|REST| API[FastAPI API]

    API --> AUTH[认证与 RBAC]
    API --> QUICK[快速检索]
    API --> DOC[文档管理]
    API --> RESEARCH[研究任务 API]

    RESEARCH --> TASK[内存任务管理器]
    TASK --> AGENT[LangGraph Agent]
    AGENT --> EVENT[内存 EventBus<br/>FastAPI StreamingResponse]
    EVENT -->|SSE| UI

    AUTH --> AUTHDB[(SQLite auth.db)]
    DOC --> FILES[(上传文件 + files.json)]
    DOC -->|索引 / 删除| RETRIEVAL[共享 Retrieval Service]
    QUICK --> RETRIEVAL
    AGENT --> RETRIEVAL
    AUTH -. allowed_upload_ids .-> RETRIEVAL

    RETRIEVAL --> VECTOR[(Chroma / Milvus)]
    RETRIEVAL --> KEYWORD[(BM25 + jieba)]
    RETRIEVAL --> MODEL[Embedding / Rerank API]
    QUICK --> LLM[LLM Provider]
    AGENT --> LLM
    AGENT --> WEB[MCP Web Search]
